(cherry picked from commit e4ec4146cc8afe52290d15148ecbff121d06a140 noble:linux-nvidia-6.17)
Signed-off-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
(cherry picked from commit cc0aa9baba777c5d3b43d2948bde33e24fd05564 resolute:linux-nvidia-bos)
Signed-off-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
